'''Shark Fin''' is a {{Rare}} item which is obtained by killing [[Sharks]] during the [[Fishing Festival]]. It is used to craft [[Shark Bait]] and the [[Raggedy Shark Tooth Necklace]].

Its enchanted form is used to craft [[Shark Scale Armor]] and the [[Rod of the Sea]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Mob Drops ===
{{Drop Sources}}
Sharks have up to a {{Green|100%}} chance to drop an extra '''Shark Fin''' by unlocking the '''Elasmobranchii Affinity''' perk at {{NPCSprite|Doug}}.

